{
  "$comment": [
    "What has actually been published, and the commit each artifact was built from.",
    "Tracked on purpose: until now this lived only in gitignored working-tree",
    "directories, so a fresh clone believed nothing had ever been released and",
    "every guard built on it passed by accident.",
    "scripts/release-state.mjs reads this; the publish scripts update it."
  ],
